  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="HH22FBAEA0509E80B804A4341B1670898A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;9. Please refer to the discussion of regulatory matters in Note 8 to the Consolidated Financial Statements of the 2025 Unitil Corporation Form 10-K and Note 7 to the Consolidated Financial Statements of the Unitil Corporation Form 10-Q for the period ended June 30, 2026, as filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission.&lt;/p&gt;
